Subject: [PATCH 1058/3799] soh: rename func_8099485C -> DoorGerudo_Idle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the resting action: on the unlock trigger it spends a small key, sets the switch flag and plays the unlock sfx; otherwise it hands the player a sliding-door interaction or the "no key" / "not yet" Navi message.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Gerudo/z_door_gerudo.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
